      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Concurrency</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Read-heavy data</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Read-Write Locks, StampedLock &amp; Read-Mostly Data</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">When thousands of threads read a config, a route table or a cache and almost nobody writes, a plain mutex makes them all queue. Learn the read-write lock and its traps (no upgrades, writer starvation), the optimistic reads of <code>StampedLock</code>, and the senior answer the kernel uses: seqlocks and RCU-style immutable snapshots.</p>\n"
  },
